# Then Phase 2 becomes very interesting

Add Jira.

Now Lore understands:

```text
Requirement
    ↓
Implementation
    ↓
Review
    ↓
Correction
    ↓
Approval
    ↓
Production outcome
```

So instead of learning merely:

> Joe likes interfaces.

It can understand:

