| --------: | --------------: | -----: |
|       100 |         £150/mo |  £180k |
|       500 |         £200/mo |  £1.2m |
|     1,000 |         £250/mo |    £3m |
|     3,000 |         £300/mo | £10.8m |

A few thousand software organisations globally is not an absurd target.

And enterprise contracts could radically change those numbers.

