I **wouldn't** make your time-tracking idea the main company.

[Harvest](https://www.getharvest.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com) already has 70,000+ companies and integrations with Jira, GitHub and Chrome. ([Harvest][6])

But the clever part of your idea wasn't really the timer.

It was:

> **Automatically understand what the developer is doing.**

That belongs inside Lore eventually.

Imagine an end-of-day report:

